{{- /*
Renders a complete GitHub Copilot CLI agent file for ~/.copilot/agents.
Call with (dict "ctx" . "id" "<agent-id>" "body" <rendered body>).

Copilot takes only name and description. It selects the model itself, and an
agent with no `tools` key gets every tool, which is what each of these wants.
*/ -}}
{{- $a := index .ctx.agents .id -}}
---
name: {{ .id }}
description: {{ $a.description | quote }}
---

{{ .body }}
